# Cross-Tool CLI Dispatch

This machine has Claude Code, Codex CLI, and Cursor CLI installed.
**When the user asks to use another tool (e.g. "让 claude review 一下", "用 codex 去审查"),
invoke it directly via terminal. Do NOT refuse or suggest manual copy-paste.**

| Tool | Command | Output |
|------|---------|--------|
| Claude Code | `claude -p "<prompt>" --allowedTools "Read Glob Grep" > out.md` | stdout |
| Codex exec | `codex exec -o out.md "<prompt>"` | `-o` flag |
| Codex review | `codex review --base main "<prompt>"` | stdout |

Output goes to `docs/reviews/<feature>/`. Details: `docs/workflow/project/usage-guide.md` §11.

Cross-platform sync: `CLAUDE.md` §Cross-Tool CLI Dispatch · `AGENTS.md` §3.
